  "privacyPolicyLastUpdated": "Last updated: August 6, 2026",
  "privacyPolicyNotificationsContent": "If you grant permission, Karmic Healing schedules local notifications for reminders. Notification titles, text, and identifiers are used by the operating system to display and open those reminders; they are not sent to our servers. You can change notification access at any time in your device settings.",
